  "title": "AEP Texas Advances Reliability and Growth with Federal Funding Expected to Save Customers $685 Million",
  "summary": "AEP Texas, a subsidiary of American Electric Power, has entered into an agreement for a loan of up to $3.26 billion from the U.S. Department of Energy&rsquo;s&nbsp;Office of Energy Dominance Financing&nbsp;to help fund infrastructure investments to improve resiliency and deliver an estimated $685 million in total savings to customers over 30 years.",
